    "section": "13. Terrain",
    "ruleNumber": "13.04",
    "summary": "Low walls and barricades are examples of Light Terrain. Light features can shelter models from attacks without slowing their movement. See Terrain and Movement for how models cross them and Benefit of Cover for when a target qualifies. An area with a light feature is Obscuring.",
